dX7g&oe=6AE20F83"}, "display_name": "Merlin's Chess", "keywords": ["chess", "wizard", "board", "magic", "club"], "long_description": "**The world\u2019s most legendary board game reimagined with magic, battles, and VR.**\n\nWhether you're here to relax, learn, or compete, Merlin\u2019s Chess brings strategy and fantasy together in the most immersive way possible.\n\n# Includes:\n\n**\ud83d\udea8 Official CHESS.COM Integration!**\n\nChallenge over 200 million Chess.com users, or play against official Chess.com Bots of the world champions, athletes, and celebrity content creators. Enjoy first-of-kind cross-play.\n{1672858073373438}\n\n**\u265f\ufe0f Animated Chessboards**\n\nMassive or tabletop-sized pieces come to life and clash each other with sound and visual effects.\n{665555099586111}\n\n**\u270b\ud83c\udffb Full Hand Tracking Support**\n{1750083772244542}\n\n**\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f Voice Commands**\n\nCommand the board like a true wizard. Use natural language to move pieces, and perform in-game actions.{2107862396361663}\n\n**\ud83c\udfa8 Environments & Piece Sets**\n\nChoose between various theme options to craft your own gameplay experience.{1009389611384771}\n\n**\ud83c\udf10 Multiple Game Modes**\n\nUse Casual/Ranked modes to play chess with popular Time Controls. Switch to Spectator Mode to join others and make it a Chess Party, or test your skills against AI opponents in AI Mode.{1397490261378212}\n\n**\ud83d\udc6bMake New Friends**\n\nCustomizable Avatars, Voice Chat, and Friendship System. Find your people, or bring your own. Includes safety features like Mute & Block.{9786338901402296}\n\n# Upcoming Features\n- Puzzle Mode\n- Mixed Reality Support\n- Merlin's Chess Academy\n- New Environments, Piece Sets, AI Opponents", "short_description": "The world\u2019s most legendary board game\u2014reimagined in VR with magic, battles, and friends. Play immersive animated chess with voice commands, hand tracking. Comes with first-of-kind Official Chess.com Integration and cross-play support!\n\nBattle AI or players, customize your board, spectate live matches, and explore magical environments. Whether you\u2019re learning, competing, or just vibing\u2014this is chess like never before.\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Teleporter Realities", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://merlinschess.gg/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://merlinschess.gg/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "MechaTurtle Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://merlinschess.gg/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["STRATEGY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "25901273672870445"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1466995878318638_7571756294986394024_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W-83Q-BLEncQ7kNvwE3Hlhk&_nc_oc=Adq15sh0oORVlEz2eyc4BWGZ8TJzb9anzH6a6r99VRdpvYMlZP-VeOaRiOnuD0G6qag&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMcbZD3mLo65-ilqpLPyvR1_qoggtCrkaZgkKGWCSF7sA&oe=6AE21355"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Merlin's Chess", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics":